# Non-Rust-workspace top-level dirs (verified 2026-08-01: none of these appear
# in root Cargo.toml's [workspace] members — which live only under api/, cmd/,
# domains/, drivers/, infrastructure/, mcp/, platform/, rails/, services/,
# worktree-manager/ — and no Cargo.toml anywhere in the repo has a `path =`
# dependency reaching into any of them either. Excluding them cut the build
# context from >1.5GB to a fraction of that; surfaces/ alone is ~3GB of
# frontend/mobile source no Rust build needs. Re-verify before trusting this
# if the workspace member list changes.
alabs-generated-courses
alabs-module-template
bin
config
dev
docs
infra
packages
patches
remix-content
research
resources
scripts
sdk
spec
surfaces
tests
tools
ui

